<title>POLAND: Zloty fixed flat at 2.96 pct from parity rate.</title>
<headline>Zloty fixed flat at 2.96 pct from parity rate.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0890 to the dollar, down from 3.0770 on Thursday and at 1.8110 to the mark, up from 1.8160, it said.</p>
<p>The central bank fixed the zloty at an average of 2.96 percent from the weighted dollar and mark parity rates, flat from Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
